{"title":"Career Roadmap — Service Designer","role":"Service Designer","summary":"A Service Designer designs and improves the complete experience of a service by understanding the needs of users, employees, organisations, and other stakeholders.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Transportation / Automobile Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Service Designer designs and improves the complete experience of a service by understanding the needs of users, employees, organisations, and other stakeholders."},{"type":"p","text":"Unlike a product designer who may primarily focus on a physical or digital product, a Service Designer looks at the entire service ecosystem."},{"type":"p","text":"For example, improving a hospital appointment service may involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient experience"},{"text":"Doctor workflow"},{"text":"Reception process"},{"text":"Appointment booking"},{"text":"Payment"},{"text":"Waiting time"},{"text":"Digital interfaces"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Follow-up"},{"text":"Internal operational processes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The Service Designer connects these touchpoints into a coherent service."},{"type":"h","text":"Core idea"},{"type":"flow","items":["Understand the people","understand the system","identify problems","redesign the service","prototype","test","implement","measure"]}]},{"heading":"What a Service Designer Does","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conducting user and stakeholder research"},{"text":"Identifying service pain points"},{"text":"Mapping customer journeys"},{"text":"Mapping organisational processes"},{"text":"Creating service blueprints"},{"text":"Conducting interviews and observations"},{"text":"Facilitating workshops"},{"text":"Designing service concepts"},{"text":"Prototyping new service experiences"},{"text":"Testing concepts with users"},{"text":"Collaborating with business and technology teams"},{"text":"Designing sustainable and inclusive services"},{"text":"Supporting organisational transformation"},{"text":"Measuring service performance"},{"text":"Translating research into actionable recommendations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Service Designer therefore needs both creative design skills and systems thinking."}]},{"heading":"Service Design vs Related Careers","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"UX Designer"},{"text":"Digital product experience"}],[{"text":"Product Designer"},{"text":"Product + user experience"}],[{"text":"Industrial Designer"},{"text":"Physical products"}],[{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Business requirements and processes"}],[{"text":"Management Consultant"},{"text":"Organisational/business problems"}],[{"text":"Service Designer"},{"text":"End-to-end service ecosystem"}],[{"text":"Design Researcher"},{"text":"Research and human insights"}],[{"text":"CX Designer"},{"text":"Customer experience"}],[{"text":"Sustainability Designer"},{"text":"Environmental/social impact"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"These roles can overlap, and organisations may use different titles for similar responsibilities."}]},{"heading":"Core Service Design Concepts","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A student should master:"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer Journey"},{"type":"flow","items":["Awareness","Discovery","Booking","Service Delivery","Payment","Follow-up","Retention"]},{"type":"p","text":"The designer examines every stage and identifies:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pain points"},{"text":"Emotional states"},{"text":"Friction"},{"text":"Opportunities"},{"text":"Failure points"}]}]},{"heading":"Service Blueprint","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A service blueprint connects the customer's experience with the organisation's internal operations."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"CUSTOMER"},{"type":"p","text":"────────────────────────"},{"type":"flow","items":["Books appointment","Visits hospital","Consults doctor","Receives prescription"]},{"type":"p","text":"FRONTSTAGE"},{"type":"p","text":"────────────────────────"},{"type":"flow","items":["Website","Reception","Doctor","Pharmacy"]},{"type":"p","text":"BACKSTAGE"},{"type":"p","text":"────────────────────────"},{"type":"flow","items":["Database","Scheduling","Records","Billing"]},{"type":"p","text":"SUPPORT SYSTEMS"},{"type":"p","text":"────────────────────────"},{"type":"flow","items":["IT","Staff","Payments","Infrastructure"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most important professional capabilities for a Service Designer."}]},{"heading":"Research Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong Service Designer needs qualitative and quantitative research skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Qualitative Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User interviews"},{"text":"Contextual interviews"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"Shadowing"},{"text":"Focus groups"},{"text":"Diary studies"},{"text":"Participatory research"},{"text":"Stakeholder interviews"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Quantitative Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Surveys"},{"text":"Usage analytics"},{"text":"Customer satisfaction data"},{"text":"Conversion data"},{"text":"Operational metrics"},{"text":"Service performance indicators"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is not simply to collect information but to convert evidence into design opportunities."}]},{"heading":"Design Research Process","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A typical project can follow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Discover","Research","Synthesize","Define","Ideate","Prototype","Test","Implement","Measure","Iterate"]},{"type":"p","text":"This process should remain flexible rather than being treated as a rigid sequence."}]},{"heading":"Important Research Techniques","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Students should learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Stakeholder Mapping"},{"type":"p","text":"Identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customers"},{"text":"Employees"},{"text":"Managers"},{"text":"Partners"},{"text":"Government agencies"},{"text":"Vendors"},{"text":"Technology providers"},{"text":"Communities"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Persona Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand representative users based on research."},{"type":"h","text":"Empathy Mapping"},{"type":"p","text":"Explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Says"},{"text":"Thinks"},{"text":"Does"},{"text":"Feels"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Journey Mapping"},{"type":"p","text":"Identify the user's experience across different touchpoints."},{"type":"h","text":"Ecosystem Mapping"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the larger system surrounding the service."}]},{"heading":"Sustainable Service Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Because this B.Des specialisation includes Design for Social Innovation / Sustainable Design, the student should go beyond customer convenience."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Circular economy"},{"text":"Sustainable consumption"},{"text":"Resource efficiency"},{"text":"Waste reduction"},{"text":"Inclusive design"},{"text":"Social impact"},{"text":"Community participation"},{"text":"Sustainable mobility"},{"text":"Responsible technology"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Climate-conscious services"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"Instead of simply redesigning a food-delivery app, a sustainable service designer might investigate:"},{"type":"p","text":"How can food delivery reduce packaging waste, inefficient transportation and food waste while maintaining convenience?"},{"type":"p","text":"This requires systems-level thinking."}]},{"heading":"Social Innovation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Service Designers can work on complex social problems such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Healthcare access"},{"text":"Education"},{"text":"Public transportation"},{"text":"Rural development"},{"text":"Financial inclusion"},{"text":"Public services"},{"text":"Waste management"},{"text":"Water access"},{"text":"Employment"},{"text":"Elder care"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Digital inclusion"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The focus is not merely on creating an attractive interface."},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is to improve the system and experience around a real-world problem."}]},{"heading":"Tools","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Service Designer should become comfortable with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Research & Collaboration"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Miro"},{"text":"Mural"},{"text":"FigJam"},{"text":"Notion"},{"text":"Google Workspace"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"Adobe Creative Cloud"},{"text":"Illustrator"},{"text":"Photoshop"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mapping"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Journey-mapping tools"},{"text":"Service blueprinting tools"},{"text":"Diagramming software"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Google Sheets"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"Basic SQL"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Jira"},{"text":"Trello"},{"text":"Asana"},{"text":"Notion"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact software varies by organisation."}]},{"heading":"Data & Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern Service Designers benefit from basic analytical capability."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Descriptive statistics"},{"text":"Survey analysis"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Customer analytics"},{"text":"Funnel analysis"},{"text":"Conversion analysis"},{"text":"Satisfaction metrics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful service metrics include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer Satisfaction"},{"text":"Customer Effort"},{"text":"Net Promoter Score"},{"text":"Waiting time"},{"text":"Completion rate"},{"text":"Drop-off rate"},{"text":"Resolution time"},{"text":"Service adoption"},{"text":"Retention"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The designer should understand why a metric changes, not just report it."}]},{"heading":"B.Des Academic Roadmap","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Design Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design thinking"},{"text":"Visual communication"},{"text":"Drawing"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Human-centred design"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Basic prototyping"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Start studying:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UX"},{"text":"Human behaviour"},{"text":"Social problems"},{"text":"Sustainability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target"},{"type":"p","text":"Complete small projects involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User observation"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Problem identification"},{"text":"Basic service journeys"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Human-Centred & Service Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design research"},{"text":"Personas"},{"text":"Journey maps"},{"text":"Stakeholder maps"},{"text":"Service blueprints"},{"text":"Ideation"},{"text":"Co-design"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Usability testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"Redesign the student experience for a university administration service."},{"type":"p","text":"Study the complete process:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Student Need","Information Search","Application","Documentation","Approval","Payment","Service Delivery"]},{"type":"p","text":"Identify the major pain points and redesign the system."}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Systems & Sustainable Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Systems thinking"},{"text":"Social innovation"},{"text":"Sustainability"},{"text":"Circular economy"},{"text":"Public services"},{"text":"Organisational processes"},{"text":"Business models"},{"text":"Service ecosystems"},{"text":"Impact measurement"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Begin working with multidisciplinary teams."},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"A sustainable mobility project could involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Commuters"},{"text":"Drivers"},{"text":"Transport operators"},{"text":"Government"},{"text":"Infrastructure"},{"text":"Payment systems"},{"text":"Technology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student learns to design the ecosystem, not just an app."}]},{"heading":"Final Year — Professional Service Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The final year should include a substantial real-world project."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible projects:"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare Service"},{"type":"p","text":"Improve:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Patient appointment","consultation","payment","follow-up"]},{"type":"h","text":"Education Service"},{"type":"p","text":"Improve:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Student admission","orientation","learning","support","graduation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Public Service"},{"type":"p","text":"Improve:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Citizen request","application","verification","approval","delivery"]},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainability"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a:"},{"type":"p","text":"Circular packaging return service"},{"type":"h","text":"Financial Inclusion"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a:"},{"type":"p","text":"Low-friction financial service for underserved communities"}]},{"heading":"Portfolio Requirements","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Service Design portfolio should demonstrate problem-solving and systems thinking."},{"type":"p","text":"Each case study should contain:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem","Context","Research","Stakeholders","Insights","Opportunity Areas","Journey Map","Service Blueprint","Ideation","Prototype","Testing","Iteration","Final Service","Impact / Measurement"]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong portfolio artefacts"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research plans"},{"text":"Interview insights"},{"text":"Personas"},{"text":"Journey maps"},{"text":"Stakeholder maps"},{"text":"Ecosystem maps"},{"text":"Service blueprints"},{"text":"Prototypes"},{"text":"Workshop outputs"},{"text":"Testing results"},{"text":"Before/after service flows"},{"text":"Impact metrics"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Portfolio Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Project","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Hospital Service Redesign"},{"text":"Healthcare + research"}],[{"text":"University Service Redesign"},{"text":"Journey mapping"}],[{"text":"Public Transport Service"},{"text":"Systems thinking"}],[{"text":"Rural Banking Service"},{"text":"Social innovation"}],[{"text":"Waste Management Service"},{"text":"Sustainability"}],[{"text":"E-commerce Returns"},{"text":"Service operations"}],[{"text":"Government Citizen Service"},{"text":"Public-sector design"}],[{"text":"Sustainable Food Service"},{"text":"Circular design"}],[{"text":"Elder Care Service"},{"text":"Inclusive design"}],[{"text":"Digital Financial Service"},{"text":"UX + service design"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"At least 2–3 projects should involve real users or stakeholders."}]},{"heading":"Internship Roadmap","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Internships should ideally begin by the second or third year."},{"type":"h","text":"Suitable roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Service Design Intern"},{"text":"UX Research Intern"},{"text":"Design Research Intern"},{"text":"Customer Experience Intern"},{"text":"Experience Design Intern"},{"text":"Innovation Design Intern"},{"text":"Design Strategy Intern"},{"text":"Sustainability Design Intern"},{"text":"Social Innovation Intern"},{"text":"Business Design Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Suitable organisations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design consultancies"},{"text":"Technology companies"},{"text":"Banks"},{"text":"Healthcare organisations"},{"text":"E-commerce companies"},{"text":"Mobility companies"},{"text":"Government innovation programmes"},{"text":"NGOs"},{"text":"Sustainability organisations"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Service-oriented startups"}]}]},{"heading":"Strong Career Specialisations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Digital Service Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital services"},{"text":"Apps"},{"text":"Websites"},{"text":"Omnichannel experiences"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Healthcare Service Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient journeys"},{"text":"Hospital systems"},{"text":"Healthcare access"},{"text":"Digital health services"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Public Service Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government services"},{"text":"Citizen experience"},{"text":"Public systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Sustainability Service Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Circular economy"},{"text":"Sustainable consumption"},{"text":"Resource efficiency"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Social Innovation"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communities"},{"text":"Social impact"},{"text":"Development problems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Business Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"New services"},{"text":"Business models"},{"text":"Customer value"},{"text":"Innovation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"7. CX / Customer Experience"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer journeys"},{"text":"Service quality"},{"text":"Omnichannel experience"},{"text":"Customer retention"}]}]},{"heading":"AI & Service Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI is increasingly useful for Service Designers."},{"type":"h","text":"AI can assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Interview transcription"},{"text":"Research synthesis"},{"text":"Theme identification"},{"text":"Survey analysis"},{"text":"Journey analysis"},{"text":"Customer feedback classification"},{"text":"Persona hypothesis generation"},{"text":"Scenario generation"},{"text":"Rapid prototyping"},{"text":"Service simulation"},{"text":"Data analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["10,000 Customer Reviews","AI-assisted Classification","Pain Point Categories","Human Validation","Service Opportunities","Prototype"]},{"type":"p","text":"AI should support research and synthesis rather than replace direct engagement with users."}]},{"heading":"Future Service Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Emerging areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"AI Service Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Designing services where AI agents interact with customers."},{"type":"h","text":"Agentic Services"},{"type":"p","text":"Future services may involve:"},{"type":"flow","items":["User","AI Agent","Multiple Business Systems","Service Execution","Human Escalation"]},{"type":"p","text":"Service Designers will need to think about:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Trust"},{"text":"Transparency"},{"text":"Human oversight"},{"text":"Failure handling"},{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"AI bias"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainable Services"},{"type":"p","text":"Increasing demand for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Circular business models"},{"text":"Product-as-a-service"},{"text":"Shared mobility"},{"text":"Repair services"},{"text":"Reuse systems"},{"text":"Low-carbon services"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After B.Des, relevant postgraduate options include:"},{"type":"h","text":"M.Des"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Service Design"},{"text":"Strategic Design"},{"text":"Interaction Design"},{"text":"Design for Social Innovation"},{"text":"Sustainable Design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Other Master's"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MA Service Design"},{"text":"Design Management"},{"text":"Innovation Design"},{"text":"Design Strategy"},{"text":"Sustainability"},{"text":"Human-Computer Interaction"},{"text":"UX Research"},{"text":"Social Innovation"},{"text":"Business Design"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The best programme depends on whether the student wants to specialise in design research, strategy, sustainability, technology, or social impact."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A typical pathway:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des","Service Design Intern","Junior Service Designer","Service Designer","Senior Service Designer","Lead Service Designer","Principal Service Designer","Design Director / Service Design Director"]},{"type":"p","text":"Alternative:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Service Designer","Design Strategist","Senior Design Strategist","Strategy / Innovation Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"Another route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Service Designer","UX Researcher","Senior UX Researcher","Research Lead"]}]},{"heading":"Related Careers","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A B.Des in this area can lead to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Service Designer"},{"text":"UX Designer"},{"text":"UX Researcher"},{"text":"Design Researcher"},{"text":"Experience Designer"},{"text":"Customer Experience Designer"},{"text":"Business Designer"},{"text":"Design Strategist"},{"text":"Innovation Consultant"},{"text":"Sustainability Designer"},{"text":"Social Innovation Designer"},{"text":"Design Consultant"},{"text":"Transformation Consultant"},{"text":"Public Service Designer"},{"text":"Design Research Lead"}]}]},{"heading":"Skill-Gap Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Beginner","Job Ready","Advanced"],"rows":[[{"text":"User Research"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Journey Mapping"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Expert"}],[{"text":"Service Blueprinting"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Expert"}],[{"text":"Systems Thinking"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Expert"}],[{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Facilitation"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Intermediate"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Sustainability"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Intermediate"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Data Analysis"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Intermediate"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"UX"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Visualisation"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Business Thinking"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Intermediate"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Core Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design thinking"},{"text":"Human-centred design"},{"text":"Service design"},{"text":"Systems thinking"},{"text":"Visual communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User interviews"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"Surveys"},{"text":"Qualitative analysis"},{"text":"Quantitative analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Service Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Journey mapping"},{"text":"Service blueprinting"},{"text":"Ecosystem mapping"},{"text":"Stakeholder mapping"},{"text":"Co-design"},{"text":"Prototyping"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business models"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Customer experience"},{"text":"Basic economics"},{"text":"Innovation strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainability"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Circular economy"},{"text":"Social impact"},{"text":"Sustainable systems"},{"text":"Inclusive design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"Miro/FigJam"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Basic analytics"},{"text":"AI tools"},{"text":"Basic UX/UI"}]}]},{"heading":"Placement Preparation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Students should prepare for case-study interviews."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical question:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"A hospital has a long patient waiting time. How would you redesign the service?\""},{"type":"p","text":"A strong response should cover:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Understand","Research","Map Current Service","Identify Root Causes","Prioritise Problems","Ideate","Prototype","Test","Measure"]},{"type":"p","text":"Interviewers may evaluate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research thinking"},{"text":"Problem framing"},{"text":"Systems thinking"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Creativity"},{"text":"Business understanding"},{"text":"Ability to work with constraints"}]}]},{"heading":"What Students Should Avoid","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"❌ Treating Service Design as only UI design"},{"type":"p","text":"UI may be one touchpoint within a much larger service."},{"type":"h","text":"❌ Designing without research"},{"type":"p","text":"A service solution should be based on evidence."},{"type":"h","text":"❌ Ignoring operational constraints"},{"type":"p","text":"A beautiful customer journey cannot work if employees, technology or infrastructure cannot support it."},{"type":"h","text":"❌ Only producing visual diagrams"},{"type":"p","text":"Maps and blueprints are tools for reasoning, not the final objective."},{"type":"h","text":"❌ Ignoring sustainability"},{"type":"p","text":"For this specialisation, environmental and social consequences should be considered."},{"type":"h","text":"❌ Ignoring implementation"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong Service Designer considers:"},{"type":"p","text":"Can the organisation actually deliver this service?"}]},{"heading":"Ideal 4-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Expected Output"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Design + research foundations"},{"text":"2–3 basic service studies"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"UX + service design"},{"text":"Journey maps + blueprints"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Systems + sustainability"},{"text":"Real-world service project"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Professional practice"},{"text":"4–6 strong case studies"}]]}]},{"heading":"Best Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, an ideal candidate should have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B.Des in Design for Social Innovation / Sustainable Design"},{"text":"Strong service-design fundamentals"},{"text":"Human-centred research skills"},{"text":"Interview and observation experience"},{"text":"Journey mapping"},{"text":"Service blueprinting"},{"text":"Stakeholder mapping"},{"text":"Systems thinking"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Workshop/facilitation experience"},{"text":"Figma + Miro/FigJam proficiency"},{"text":"Basic data analysis"},{"text":"Sustainability knowledge"},{"text":"1–2 internships or equivalent field experience"},{"text":"4–6 polished portfolio case studies"},{"text":"At least 2 projects involving real users/stakeholders"},{"text":"One sustainability/social-innovation project"},{"text":"One digital service project"},{"text":"Strong presentation and storytelling skills"},{"text":"Basic understanding of business and operations"},{"text":"AI-assisted research and prototyping skills"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strongest Graduate Profile"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des","Service Design","User Research","Journey Mapping","Service Blueprinting","Systems Thinking","Sustainability","Data Literacy","Prototyping","Real-World Projects","Strong Case-Study Portfolio"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This profile can position the graduate not only for Service Designer roles but also for adjacent careers in UX research, design strategy, business design, customer experience, innovation and sustainability consulting."}]}]}